        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "value": "<p data-block-key=\"85rhv\">Right beside Agora Circle, you will find a convenient city transit stop that connects campus to Thunder Bay. Whether you are heading downtown for shopping, meeting friends, or exploring local trails, it is an easy and affordable way to get around.</p>",
