          "type": "title",
          "value": "The City of Thunder Bay",
          "id": "634d6797-1a38-433f-9d21-de4979c31d45"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "value": "<p data-block-key=\"th422\">Nestled on the north shore of\u00a0Lake Superior, the world\u2019s largest freshwater lake, and cradled by the rugged\u00a0Nor\u2019Wester Mountain range. It\u2019s a city that offers the perfect mix of urban life and outdoor adventure\u2014a dynamic, welcoming community surrounded by some of Canada\u2019s most awe-inspiring natural landscapes.</p>",
